MemeHarbor 1.0
Maintainer: Ghostberry / horizoe10
Repository: https://github.com/horizoe10/astrbot_plugin_memeharbor

Provenance
This project evolved from the user-supplied Image Replay plugin package
(astrbot_plugin_image_replay), originally attributed to cuman / cumany:
https://github.com/cumany/astrbot_plugin_image_replay

That upstream README also credits Futureppo's Custom Menu plugin:
https://github.com/Futureppo/astrbot_plugin_custom_menu

MemeHarbor independently maintains the catalog, numbered contact sheets,
QQ Official capture/reply paths, search, tag management, recoverable deletion,
recent-send selection, embedded gallery, optional AI workflows, command-routing
compatibility fixes and data migration. It is not an official upstream release.

The supplied upstream archive did not contain a standalone license file.
No blanket relicensing of upstream material is asserted by this repository.
Original attribution is retained. A public repository alone does not specify
an additional license for its contents.

The logo was generated for this project using OpenAI's image-generation tool.
User images, credentials, databases and personal configuration files are not
part of this source distribution.
